le": ""}, {"href": "/service/", "text": "", "alt_title": "地域密着型のイメージ"}, {"href": "/service/", "text": "新聞銘柄や配布エリアを自由に選定できるため、到達させたい読者層・地域に的確な宣伝が可能です。", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service/", "text": "詳しくはこちら", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "即効性", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "", "alt_title": "即効性のイメージ"}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "新聞折込広告チラシは、各家庭・お茶の間に直接届き、興味のある紙面をゆっくり見られるので、消費行動に直結しやすく、即効性も期待できます。", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "詳しくはこちら", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "配布日指定", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "", "alt_title": "配布日指定のイメージ"}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "新聞折込広告チラシは、休刊日や特殊な日（国政選挙翌日など）を除けば折込日を自由に指定でき、枚数の制限もないので、売り出し日や、セールの内容によって折込日を設定できます。", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "詳しくはこちら", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/price/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/flow/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/faq/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/contact/", "text": "", "alt_title": "メールでお問い合わせはこちら"}, {"href": "/company/", "text": "詳細はこちら", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/company/#honsya", "text": ">>MAP", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "http://www.gifu-np.co.jp/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "#wrap", "text": "", "alt_title": "PAGETOP"}, {"href": "#wrap", "text": "PAGETOP", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/privacy/", "text": "プライバシーポリシー", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/sitemap-page/", "text": "サイトマップ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/", "text": "HOME", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/service/", "text": "部数表", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/price/", "text": "料金表", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/flow/", "text": "折込配布までの流れ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.gifu-orikomi.co.jp/gifupos/", "text": "ぎふポス", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://